 '<div class="kiosk-layout"><section class="panel kiosk-panel"><div class="kiosk-step"><span>1</span><div><h2>Where would you like to go?</h2><p>Select the department and service the patient wants to visit.</p></div></div><form id="kiosk-form"><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full-width"><label>Department *</label><select id="kiosk-department" name="department_id" required>'+('<option value="">Select department…</option>'+activeDepartments.map(d=>'<option value="'+esc(d.id)+'" '+(d.id===deptId?'selected':'')+'>'+esc(d.name)+'</option>').join(''))+'</select></div><div class="field full-width"><label>Service / clinic *</label><select id="kiosk-service" name="service_id" required>'+('<option value="">Select service…</option>'+availableServices.map(s=>'<option value="'+esc(s.id)+'">'+esc(s.name+' · '+s.code)+'</option>').join(''))+'</select><small class="muted">Only services with walk-in ticketing enabled are shown.</small></div><div class="field full-width"><label>Find patient by name or medical record number *</label><select name="patient_id" id="kiosk-patient" required>'+patientOptions(state.kioskPatient||'')+'</select><small class="muted">If this is a new patient, register them first. Avoid creating duplicate records.</small></div><div class="field full-width"><label>Queue priority</label><select name="priority"><option value="routine">Routine</option><option value="urgent">Urgent — non-emergency only</option></select></div></div><div class="inline-notice"><strong>Clinical safety</strong>For emergencies, do not wait for a routine ticket. Activate the facility emergency/triage pathway immediately.</div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn outline" type="button" data-action="refresh">Refresh data</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Issue queue ticket →</button></div></form></section><aside class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>How it works</h2><p>Simple patient routing</p></div></div><div class="panel-body quick-actions"><div class="quick-action"><span class="metric-icon">1</span><span><strong>Select department</strong><small>Choose from the departments configured by your facility.</small></span></div><div class="quick-action"><span class="metric-icon">2</span><span><strong>Select service</strong><small>Clinics are filtered by the selected department.</small></span></div><div class="quick-action"><span class="metric-icon">3</span><span><strong>Issue ticket</strong><small>A unique queue number is created by the database and shown for printing.</small></span></div></div></aside></div>';
